  "description": "CSI: Clean Scene Investigators is a mobile specialty cleanup company serving Denton, Denton County, Dallas-Fort Worth, and North Texas. CSI provides crime scene cleanup, trauma and biohazard cleanup, unattended death and decomposition cleanup, blood and bodily-fluid cleanup, hoarding cleanup, odor-source remediation, vehicle biohazard cleanup, and extreme-mess cleanup.",
  "disambiguatingDescription": "CSI: Clean Scene Investigators is the specialty cleanup company operated by C&Z Forensics LLC. Its official website is cleansceneinvestigators.com and its official 24/7 support phone is 940-654-6334. CSI is a mobile service-area business and does not publish a customer-facing street address.",
